+/* webOS: Discord's answer to adding someone to a group DM. Done, it answers with nothing (204 No
+ * Content) and the gateway's CHANNEL_RECIPIENT_ADD puts them in the group; refused, it answers with
+ * its error, {"message": ..., "code": ...}, which goes in the group as a notice and, without the
+ * person, in the debug log. user_data is a DiscordWebosGroupAdd (owned here). */
+static void
